OL,5,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,6,     FFrom Swansea's Copperopolis to
OL,7,     FConwy's centuries-old Honey Fair,
OL,8,     Fwe explore Welsh heritage,
OL,9,     Fcommunity and traditions passed
OL,10,     Fthrough generations.
OL,11,G1900 How Emily...
OL,12,     FAn uplifting exploration of life
OL,13,     Ffor Emily Nicole Roberts, a
OL,14,     Fwheelchair user with cerebral
OL,15,     Fpalsy. In this episode, Emily
OL,16,     Flooks at the world of beauty and
OL,17,     Ffashion for those with a
OL,18,     Fdisability.
